@baseUrl = http://localhost:5131
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-jwt
@staffToken = replace-with-staff-jwt
@staffId = 2

### Admin lists Staff
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Staff lists own profile only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### View Staff
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Update profile (use Staff JWT only for own ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van An",
  "phone": "+84901234567",
  "dateOfBirth": "2000-01-01"
}

### Lock Staff as Admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{staffId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

### Previously issued Staff JWT must now return 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Unlock Staff as Admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{staffId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": true }

### Staff trying to assign a role must return 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van An",
  "roles": ["Admin"]
}
